    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n41935" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἑπτα-ετής</span></b> , <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ές</span>,
			<div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b>
				=
				<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἑπτέτης</span>
			, <i>seven years old,</i>
			v.l. in
			<i><span class="en">
				Hp.
				<u>Prog.</u>
				19
			</span></i>, 
				v.l. for
				<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἑπτέτης</span>
			 in <i><span class="en">
				Pl.
				<u>Grg.</u>
				471c
			</span></i> : as fem., <i><span class="en">
				<u>IG</u>
				14.1935
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				Arr.
				<u>Ind.</u>
				9.1
			</span></i> : regul. fem. <b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἑπτα-έτις</span></b> , <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ιδος</span>, ἡ, Amyntas Epigr.<i><span class="en">
				<u>Oxy.</u>
				662.30
			</span></i> : as Adj., 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἑ. ἡλικία</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Ph.
					1.393
				</span></i>
			. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>II.</b> parox. <b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἑπτα-έτης</span></b> , <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ες</span>, <i>of seven years</i>: neut. <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἑπτάετες,</span> as Adv., <i>for
				seven years,</i>
			<i><span class="en">
				Od.
				3.304
			</span></i>,<i><span class="en">
				7.259
			</span></i>.</div>
